        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omve atalau edeta edepi ’diyi Zadoki pi Abiatari be, azini ’ba Levini Urieli pi, Asaya pie, Yoeli pie, Semaya pie, Elieli pie, Aminadabu pie dria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
